($$people-2026-10-19-people-team-weekly$$, $$People Team Weekly - 2026-10-19 (notes)$$, $$people$$, $$Hana Sato (People Team Manager)$$, $$2026-10-19$$, $$hr$$, $$current$$, NULL, NULL, $$people/2026-10-19-people-team-weekly.md$$, $$# People Team Weekly - October 19, 2026

