($$meetings-2026-09-17-atlas-retail-qbr--2$$, $$meetings-2026-09-17-atlas-retail-qbr$$, 2, $$Atlas Retail - Quarterly Business Review (call transcript)$$, $$meetings$$, $$all$$, $$current$$, $$Atlas Retail$$, NULL, $$2026-09-17$$, $$00:02:50$$, $$Atlas Retail - Quarterly Business Review (call transcript) - Transcript 00:02:50-00:03:40

