# Data Infra - Team retro, October 5, 2026

**Attendees:** Sam Patel (manager), Lena Okafor, Omar Haddad, Chris Doyle, and the Data Infra team. Rosa Delgado (HR Business Partner) joined for the last 15 minutes.

## What the team said

- DI-4410 (EU ingestion delays) has paged the team every afternoon and most nights since October 1. Several people worked past midnight four nights in a row.
- The team is one person short since a senior engineer resigned on September 18; the on-call rotation now repeats every 5 weeks instead of every 7.
- People are cancelling PTO because nobody can cover the pager.
- "If this goes on through November I'll start taking recruiter calls," said one engineer. Two others nodded.

## Commitments from Sam Patel$$),
